The legal texts come from official publications of the Togolese Republic, the Journal Officiel de la République
togolaise (https://jo.gouv.tg), retrieved 28 and 29 October 2026:

  Loi n° 2024-005 du 06/05/2024 portant Constitution de la République Togolaise, JO 69e année n° 42 bis du 6 mai 2024;
  Loi n° 2019-014 relative à la protection des données à caractère personnel, JO 64e année n° 26 ter du 29 octobre 2019;
  Loi n° 2021-012 du 18 juin 2021 portant code du travail, JO 66e année n° 26 ter du 18 juin 2021;
  Loi n° 2022-019 du 15 novembre 2022 portant modification de la loi n° 2021-012 du 18 juin 2021 portant code du
  travail, JO 67e année n° 49 bis du 15 novembre 2022.

jo.gouv.tg publishes no licence for the legal texts. They are official legal texts; their copyright status is not
confirmed here, and they are reproduced with the attribution above.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line;
spacing, apostrophes, quotes, dashes, ligatures and line-end hyphenation were normalised; running heads, page
numbers, headings, the enacting formula and the signatures were removed; and the text was arranged as git commits
credited to the laws concerned. The wording of the law was not changed. The Journal officiel does not endorse this
repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
